# brick, and nothing in the game is random, so a frame is a place in the game.
# See tests/e2e/script.h for the grammar.

# --- the failure path: three balls lost ---------------------------------------

# The paddle never moves. Each serve breaks a brick or two on its way up and
# comes down where the paddle is not; the first is lost in frame 106.
